<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-064-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.317319" lon="-120.895546"><name>SC26-064-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 69/100; not catch probability. Center 95 ft; nearby 88–114 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-045</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.320518460233984" lon="-120.89551807829899"/><trkpt lat="35.32027492547981" lon="-120.89706428840756"/><trkpt lat="35.31983968200094" lon="-120.89795549895136"/><trkpt lat="35.31886568968203" lon="-120.89897063318013"/><trkpt lat="35.31815055160231" lon="-120.8993191083925"/><trkpt lat="35.31661870020184" lon="-120.89935873974325"/><trkpt lat="35.31607422514376" lon="-120.89915285135199"/><trkpt lat="35.31534379848323" lon="-120.89862181883653"/><trkpt lat="35.31451178855886" lon="-120.8974335157079"/><trkpt lat="35.314506051058984" lon="-120.89710370967362"/><trkpt lat="35.31486074785038" lon="-120.89676456823952"/><trkpt lat="35.31484161311087" lon="-120.89566521090512"/><trkpt lat="35.31528832853833" lon="-120.8954336626568"/><trkpt lat="35.31536120530526" lon="-120.8944419001405"/><trkpt lat="35.31581174854895" lon="-120.89443021744381"/><trkpt lat="35.31623738606566" lon="-120.89298934765615"/><trkpt lat=